&lt;li&gt;You understand why compute choices matter for Physical AI workloads: the difference between simulation-scale GPU bursts, continuous training runs for world models, and low-latency on-robot inference shapes every partnership conversation you&#39;ll have.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You stay current on the Physical AI ecosystem (from foundation model labs building world models and sim-to-real pipelines to robotics startups deploying at the edge) and you have a point of view on where it&#39;s going.&lt;/li&gt;
