&lt;li&gt;Prepare cost estimates and support commercial risk assessments to help inform location strategy and investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and compile benchmarking data on construction costs, escalation trends, and market rates across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with internal cost control resources and external cost consultants to help ensure consistency and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
