&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Data Center Technician, you will help ensure the overall availability and reliability of data center operations. This is a hands-on role focused on hardware and network diagnostics, physical repair, and support of mission-critical infrastructure. You will work onsite at one of our data center locations and may participate in an on-call rotation to support after-hours operational needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
