&lt;li&gt;Root cause analysis of hardware and software failures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training of internal teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development of documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical support to data center teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development of scripts to update server and networking hardware&lt;/li&gt;
