&lt;p&gt;If you’re someone who thrives in a dynamic, fast-paced environment, enjoys solving complex problems, and is eager to make a significant impact, CoreWeave is the place for you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CoreWeave is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Director and Managing Associate General Counsel, Commercial – Americas &lt;/strong&gt;to lead the legal team supporting the Americas Global Field Organization (GFO) and its enterprise sales of cloud products and services. Reporting to the VP &amp;amp; Deputy General Counsel, Global Commercial &amp;amp; Business Operations, this role requires an experienced people manager with a demonstrated record of leading, coaching, and developing a high-performing commercial legal team. This leader will position the team to keep pace with a fast-moving and growing sales organization, drive successful business outcomes, and serve as the primary legal partner to the VP of Americas GFO and their leadership team. The role also requires a hands-on approach, including directly supporting complex cloud SaaS and Infrastructure-as-a-Service (IaaS) customer transactions, and strengthening collaboration with colleagues across LGA, Sales, Product, Security, Privacy, Engineering, Finance, and Operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, manage, and develop a high-performing team of commercial lawyers supporting the fast-paced and rapidly growing Americas GFO sales organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as primary legal counsel and trusted advisor to the VP of Americas GFO and their leadership team, helping shape and execute go-to-market and sales strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide hands-on support on multiple concurrent transactions, including drafting, reviewing, negotiating, and closing complex commercial transactions, including SaaS, Infrastructure-as-a-Service (IaaS), and professional services agreements with enterprise customers and strategic partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive operational efficiency for a fast-moving sales organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with LGA subject-matter experts, outside counsel, and business stakeholders across Product, Security, Privacy, Finance, and Operations to structure transactions, manage risk, and resolve deal obstacles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and improve repeatable playbooks, templates, policies, and processes to improve deal velocity and consistency that enable efficient and scalable support for a rapidly moving business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the broader legal organization on cross-initiatives, knowledge-sharing, and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear expectations, provide meaningful coaching and feedback, and support the professional development of team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;J.D. and active bar membership in good standing in at least one U.S. jurisdiction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of relevant legal experience, including negotiating complex commercial technology agreements (SaaS, cloud, IaaS, or similar), including data protection, security, and privacy provisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience managing, coaching, and developing a team of commercial lawyers, preferably in a fast-paced, high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to act as a trusted advisor to senior business executives, with strong business judgment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration skills, with a track record of working and orchestrating effectively across multiple stakeholders to drive successful outcomes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A pragmatic, &quot;roll up your sleeves&quot; approach to both managing a team while also personally engaging on multiple deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, negotiation, and drafting skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, high-growth environment with evolving priorities and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wondering if you’re a good fit? &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe in investing in our people, and value candidates who can bring their own diversified experiences to our teams – even if you aren&#39;t a 100% skill or experience match.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Here are a few qualities we’ve found compatible with our team. If some of this describes you, we’d love to talk.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
