&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As Director of Field Enablement, you will define and operate a scalable enablement charter that equips Sales, Customer Experience, and GTM teams to consistently deliver for customers. This is a highly visible leadership role responsible for mechanisms, programs, and tooling that improve seller productivity, shorten ramp time, and drive predictable revenue outcomes. You will work backwards from customer and business needs, partnering closely with executive leadership to raise the bar across the revenue organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own the end-to-end field enablement strategy aligned to GTM priorities and long-term business growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Establish durable mechanisms for onboarding, certification, and continuous learning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
