&lt;li&gt;Engage and drive with the Controllership teams opportunities for process improvements and change management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the team in writing and reviewing business requirements documents for Controllership system transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the teams through control assessments, in particular with process and system changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build on and maintain a master data governance process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
