&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdnti _1ibi0s33y _1ibi0s34u&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;We are seeking a detail-oriented Finance Manager to join our Finance team and drive strategic insights around operating expenditures. In this role, you will partner closely with business stakeholders to build comprehensive budgets, forecasts, and headcount planning models that support CoreWeave&#39;s rapid growth. You will help shape how we allocate resources, improve financial discipline, and deliver clear, actionable insights to leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdnti _1ibi0s33y _1ibi0s34u&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;wnfdntf&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Partner with business leaders to develop annual budgets and quarterly forecasts, providing strategic guidance on resource allocation and cost optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Build, maintain, and enhance financial and headcount planning models to support scenario analysis and long-range planning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Enhance and standardize FP&amp;amp;A processes, tools, and reporting frameworks to improve forecasting accuracy and operational visibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Serve as a trusted finance partner to functional teams by evaluating new initiatives, conducting ROI and scenario analyses, and supporting business cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
