&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in FP&amp;amp;A, corporate development, investment banking, private equity, or similar analytical finance roles.&lt;/p&gt;
