&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;1:1-1:20;0-19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;3:1-3:405;21-425&quot;&gt;The Capacity Finance Team supports the planning, deployment, and operations of the CoreWeave&#39;s fleet of data center hardware. Partnering directly with Capacity Planning, Fleet Engineering and Operations teams, Capacity Finance helps forecast CoreWeave&#39;s finances and drive profitability by delivering data driven insights related future hardware deployments and fleet operations through a financial lens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;5:1-5:20;427-446&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;7:1-7:519;448-966&quot;&gt;CoreWeave is seeking a Finance Manager to join our Capacity Finance team. This person will support the Director of Capacity Finance to prepare, analyze, and report financial and operational information to increase financial transparency, drive performance, and promote proactive business planning. This person will work cross-functionally with a variety of stakeholders at all levels of Coreweave and have frequent opportunities to interact with and support key executive level decision makers such as the CFO and COO.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-9:24;968-991&quot;&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-17:92;993-1983&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-11:51;993-1043&quot;&gt;Lead GPU capacity planning function within FP&amp;amp;A.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;12:1-12:163;1044-1206&quot;&gt;Drive financial planning and forecasting, including the maintenance, updating, and refining of existing financial forecast models, budget models, and databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;13:1-13:175;1207-1381&quot;&gt;Own infrastructure reporting and forecasts, including complex multiregional capital expenditure models and unit economics analysis across a large fleet of computing assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;14:1-14:119;1382-1500&quot;&gt;Coordinate closely with Engineering and Operations teams to track, report, and forecast infrastructure-related KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;15:1-15:246;1501-1746&quot;&gt;Generate monthly, quarterly, and annual reports on financial results, budget variance analysis, scenario analysis, stress tests, and KPI results, communicating the analyses to key stakeholders such as executive leadership and department heads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;16:1-16:145;1747-1891&quot;&gt;Partner with capacity planning, fleet operations, and supply chain teams to ensure accuracy of forecasts and capital expenditure optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;17:1-17:92;1892-1983&quot;&gt;Support Fixed Asset Accounting team on improvement of accounting and reporting processes.&lt;/li&gt;
