&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;24:1-24:140;2327-2466&quot;&gt;Advanced proficiency in Excel with a track record of building and maintaining complex models (power query, complex array formulas, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
