&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven hands-on experience in end-to-end logistics and inventory management, ideally within the IT sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in cycle counts and/or audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organisational and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented with a high level of accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt to a dynamic and fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in or awareness of 5S methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
