&lt;li&gt;Own the configuration, optimization, and ongoing management of CWU&#39;s LMS and learning technology platforms — including user management, course catalog architecture, system integrations, and workflow logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the evaluation and implementation of new tools and platform integrations; drive technical onboarding and change management for platform changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design system architecture and processes that support CWU&#39;s program delivery model at scale across multiple sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with IT, HRIS, and vendor contacts to ensure platform performance, security, and integration health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain comprehensive system documentation and governance standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data, Analytics &amp;amp; Insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
