&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5–8+ years of experience in L&amp;amp;D operations, HR technology, learning analytics, or a closely related field, with increasing scope and ownership over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep hands-on experience with enterprise LMS platforms — configuration and optimization, not just day-to-day administration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience designing or owning learning measurement frameworks or analytics programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of identifying operational gaps, designing solutions, and implementing them with minimal direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a high-growth technology company is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
