&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Provide regular 1:1 coaching sessions focused on time management, objection handling, prospecting strategies, and active listening skills.&lt;/p&gt;
