&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdnti _1ibi0s33y _1ibi0s34u&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;As a Sales Development Manager at CoreWeave, you’ll lead a team of Sales Development Representatives (SDRs) responsible for outbound prospecting and managing inbound leads. You will play a key role in coaching, mentoring, and driving the strategy of the SDR team while scaling our outreach efforts. If you thrive in fast-growing environments, enjoy building teams from the ground up, and are excited about collaborating across departments, this role is for you. You’ll work closely with leaders across Sales, Marketing, Product, and senior leadership to align our prospecting efforts with company goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;wnfdnti _1ibi0s33y _1ibi0s34u&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;wnfdntf&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Lead daily operations and performance management for SDRs to ensure key metrics and quotas are consistently achieved.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Recruit, onboard, and ramp new SDRs with a comprehensive training program, including CoreWeave’s product knowledge, buyer personas, competitive landscape, and prospecting tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Provide regular 1:1 coaching sessions focused on time management, objection handling, prospecting strategies, and active listening skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Sales and Marketing leadership on pipeline generation strategies to achieve company targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Build and maintain a library of prospecting resources for the SDR team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Foster a positive, high-performance team culture centered on productivity, development, and well-being.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Drive operational excellence by continuously innovating and refining SDR processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Track and analyze key performance metrics to ensure data-driven decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdnte _1ibi0s33w&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Develop clear career paths and leadership opportunities for team members.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
