&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Growth-oriented mindset and positive attitude that fosters motivation and team success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
