&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;3:1-3:287;21-307&quot;&gt;CoreWeave is scaling a global data center footprint to support the world&#39;s most advanced AI workloads. As we grow rapidly, our ability to operate safely, consistently, and at speed depends on how effectively operational practices are understood, improved, and enabled across facilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;5:1-5:20;309-328&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;7:1-7:403;330-732&quot;&gt;CoreWeave is seeking an Operations Enablement Analyst, Data Center Operations to focus on analyzing how operations are performed, identifying opportunities to improve clarity, and enabling teams through the most effective mechanisms. This role will work directly with technicians, engineers, security, and compliance partners to observe and assess real-world execution across the data center lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-9:366;734-1099&quot;&gt;In this role, enablement may take the form of documenting standard operating procedures, creating runbooks, building training and onboarding content, or other approaches. Analysis and assessment drive the work in this role. Alignment with organizational objectives is foundational, and outputs are selected based on what enables safe, consistent execution at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-11:23;1101-1123&quot;&gt;In this role you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;13:1-22:126;1125-2343&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;13:1-13:143;1125-1267&quot;&gt;Compare work across sites and teams to identify risks, gaps, or inconsistencies and make recommendations that improve operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;14:1-14:122;1268-1389&quot;&gt;Influence outcomes by applying structured thinking, sound judgment, and a close partnership with subject matter experts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;15:1-15:88;1390-1477&quot;&gt;Ensure operational practices are clearly defined, well understood, and ready to scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;16:1-16:186;1478-1663&quot;&gt;Leverage modern tooling, including AI and LLM-based workflows, to accelerate analysis, synthesis, and enablement, with final outputs validated through real-world operational expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;17:1-17:105;1664-1768&quot;&gt;Support physical security, regulatory compliance, and audit readiness through procedural documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;18:1-18:114;1769-1882&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain SOPs, runbooks, and guidelines where documentation is the appropriate enablement mechanism&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;19:1-19:112;1883-1994&quot;&gt;Support onboarding and training programs by contributing accurate operational content and education materials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;20:1-20:126;1995-2120&quot;&gt;Identify and support other enablement approaches, including training sessions or knowledge-sharing programs, as appropriate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;21:1-21:97;2121-2217&quot;&gt;Partner with subject matter experts to validate enablement materials and proposed improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;22:1-22:126;2218-2343&quot;&gt;Ensure operational practices and enablement materials support safety, physical security, regulatory, and audit requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
