&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive understanding of the distinct roles, responsibilities, and accountability structures across the development and construction lifecycles, with a proven ability to manage formal project transitions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to exercise sound judgment and maintain operational momentum in high-growth environments, including the capacity to act effectively when faced with ambiguity or incomplete data sets.&lt;/li&gt;
