&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct in-depth market research to identify emerging trends, workloads, technologies, and potential opportunities in the AI Hyperscaler domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with product and engineering and design teams to align different products in CoreWeave’s portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the voice of the customer within the organization, integrating customer feedback and requirements into product development to ensure maximum satisfaction and usability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Liaise with marketing, sales, and customer support teams to ensure successful product launches, market positioning, and ongoing lifecycle management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
