&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be a key member of CoreWeave&#39;s Revenue Accounting function, driving significant process improvements, ensuring our financial reporting is accurate and efficient, and developing future team members. You will present revenue results to leaders in Accounting and FP&amp;amp;A, as well as partner with other teams including Revenue Operations, Technical Revenue, Accounts Receivable, Product Management, Engineering, GL Accounting, and many other cross-functional business partners. In this role, you will ensure the accuracy of our revenue recognition and commissions accounting, in compliance with ASC 606, ASC 340, and our internal accounting policies. You will also contribute to the design and implementation of numerous SOX controls. This role reports to the Senior Manager of Commercial (Revenue) Accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
