&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;3:1-3:466;21-486&quot;&gt;CoreWeave&#39;s Accounting organization is scaling rapidly to support the company&#39;s explosive growth across infrastructure, cloud, and AI services. The Leasing and Joint Venture Team within Corporate Accounting is responsible for lease and Network Service Agreement (NSA) accounting across CoreWeave&#39;s global footprint, ensuring technical accuracy and compliance with applicable US GAAP standards while driving operational excellence and cross-functional collaboration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;5:1-5:20;488-507&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;7:1-7:729;509-1237&quot;&gt;We are seeking a technically strong and detail-oriented Senior Accountant to join the Leasing and Joint Venture Team. In this role, you will own the end-to-end accounting for CoreWeave&#39;s lease portfolio and Network Service Agreements (NSAs), including embedded lease identification and analysis, lease modification assessments, and month-end close activities. You will partner closely with Legal, Finance, FP&amp;amp;A, Procurement, and business teams to review contractual arrangements and communicate accounting impacts across the organization. This role sits at the intersection of technical accounting and operational excellence, offering broad exposure across a rapidly scaling global company at the forefront of AI infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-15:160;1239-2361&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-9:197;1239-1435&quot;&gt;Own the identification, documentation, and accounting analysis of embedded leases within Network Service Agreements and other contractual arrangements under applicable US GAAP guidance (ASC 842)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;10:1-10:167;1436-1602&quot;&gt;Support the month-end close process for lease-related accounts, including preparation of journal entries, balance sheet reconciliations, accruals, and flux analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-11:89;1603-1691&quot;&gt;Prepare and maintain analytics and supporting schedules for lease-related P&amp;amp;L accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;12:1-12:188;1692-1879&quot;&gt;Partner with Legal, Finance, FP&amp;amp;A, Procurement, and business teams to review new and amended contracts, assess accounting implications, and communicate findings to relevant stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;13:1-13:131;1880-2010&quot;&gt;Support the preparation of quarterly and annual financial statement disclosures related to leases and network service agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;14:1-14:191;2011-2201&quot;&gt;Identify and drive improvements to lease accounting processes, documentation, internal controls, and reporting to support scalability and compliance as CoreWeave&#39;s contract portfolio grows&lt;/li&gt;
