&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;20:1-20:139;2476-2614&quot;&gt;5+ years of progressive accounting experience, including experience in a public accounting firm or a publicly traded company environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;21:1-21:89;2615-2703&quot;&gt;Strong working knowledge of US GAAP, with specific experience applying ASC 842, Leases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;22:1-22:168;2704-2871&quot;&gt;Experience identifying and evaluating embedded leases within complex contractual arrangements such as service agreements, network agreements, or similar arrangements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;23:1-23:142;2872-3013&quot;&gt;Proven ability to support month-end close, prepare balance sheet reconciliations, and build schedules and analytics supporting P&amp;amp;L accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;24:1-24:169;3014-3182&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills and demonstrated ability to work cross-functionally with Legal, Finance, Procurement, and other business partners in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
