&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate has a strong foundation in accounting, hands-on experience with SEC reporting, and the ability to work across departments to solve problems and support business decisions. This position provides the opportunity to gain exposure to external reporting, technical accounting research, audits, and system improvements in a high-growth environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
