&lt;li&gt;Prepare quarterly and annual SEC filings (10-Q, 10-K, 8-K) including financial statements, footnotes, and MD&amp;amp;A sections in compliance with US GAAP and SEC regulations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review supporting documentation and prepare the tie-out of the financial statements and footnotes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with equity and stock-based compensation accounting, including share-based taward calculations under ASC 718 and equity rollforward schedules&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare GAAP disclosure checklists to ensure compliance with accounting and SEC guidelines and completeness of financial statements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research technical accounting matters and assist in documenting accounting positions for complex or non-routine transactions under US GAAP and SEC guidance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with FP&amp;amp;A and investor relations to provide input for earnings releases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support external auditors’ work on annual audits and quarterly reviews&lt;/li&gt;
