&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;5:1-5:366;42-407&quot;&gt;We&#39;re hiring our first dedicated Finance Systems Support team member to help build and scale our Finance Systems organization. As the Senior Business Systems Analyst, you&#39;ll own the day-to-day administration, support, and optimization of NetSuite and our broader Finance Systems ecosystem, including Coupa, Avalara, FloQast, Workato, and other integrated platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
