&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Job Requirements:&amp;nbsp;Bachelor&#39;s / US or Foreign Equivalent in Computer Science, Computer&lt;br&gt;Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Software Engineering, or related STEM fields and five (5)&lt;br&gt;years of experience in the job offered or related role. Must have five (5) years of experience with:&lt;br&gt;Maintaining and deploying Go and Python code in live software systems; Maintaining and&lt;br&gt;adapting systems that use MySQL and Postgres; Deploying and optimizing distributed systems on&lt;br&gt;cloud platforms, such as GCP, AWS, Azure; Building and maintaining using Kubernetes and&lt;br&gt;Docker; Building, deploying, and developing new features and API (Rest or gRPC); and&lt;br&gt;Maintaining and adapting systems that use Kafka or Pubsub.&lt;/p&gt;
