&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_1770241969069985273m_-2746164444908759431gmail-docs-internal-guid-131e4fb0-7fff-b4e9-ff50-e8cf32449b1b&quot;&gt;CoreWeave is The Essential Cloud for AI™. Built for pioneers by pioneers, CoreWeave delivers a platform of technology, tools, and teams that enables innovators to build and scale AI with confidence. Trusted by leading AI labs, startups, and global enterprises, CoreWeave combines superior infrastructure performance with deep technical expertise to accelerate breakthroughs and turn compute into capability. Founded in 2017, CoreWeave became a publicly traded company (Nasdaq: CRWV) in March 2025. Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.coreweave.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.coreweave.com&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1762613132717000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3D-UOhNaqEvF5BEWxjYyAU&quot;&gt;www.coreweave.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Job Title: Senior Engineer II&lt;br&gt;Employer: CoreWeave, Inc.&lt;br&gt;Loca&amp;amp;on: 33 Whitehall St, New York, NY 10004.&lt;br&gt;Req # IDNY&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Duties: Architect software systems supporting the CoreWeave Cloud Platform. Lead &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; product engineering initiatives. Write software tests. Perform code quality reviews. Mentor junior engineers. Write technical documentation. Create architectural diagrams. Translate product requirements &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;into&lt;/span&gt; units of engineering work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Telecommuting permitted&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-number&quot;&gt;20&lt;/span&gt;% of the time: work may be performed within normal commuting distance &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; the CoreWeave office &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; New York, NY.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Export Control Compliance This position requires access to export controlled information. To conform to U.S. Government export regulations applicable to that information, &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-function&quot;&gt;applicant must either &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-title&quot;&gt;be&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;) a U.S. person, defined &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-title&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;) U.S. citizen &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;or&lt;/span&gt; national, (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;ii&lt;/span&gt;) U.S. lawful permanent &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-title&quot;&gt;resident&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;green card holder&lt;/span&gt;), (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;iii&lt;/span&gt;) refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-title&quot;&gt;or&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;iv&lt;/span&gt;) asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;) eligible to access the export controlled information without a &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;required&lt;/span&gt; export authorization, &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-title&quot;&gt;or&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;) eligible &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; reasonably likely to obtain the &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;required&lt;/span&gt; export authorization &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; the applicable U.S. government agency. CoreWeave may, &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; legitimate business reasons, decline to pursue any export licensing process. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-function&quot;&gt;Job Requirements: Bachelor&#39;s/US &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;or&lt;/span&gt; Foreign Equivalent &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; Computer Science, Computer Engineering, Math, Software Engineering, &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;or&lt;/span&gt; related field &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-title&quot;&gt;eight&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-number&quot;&gt;8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;) years of experience &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; Software Engineering. Must have &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-title&quot;&gt;seven&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-number&quot;&gt;7&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;) years of experience &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;with&lt;/span&gt; writing software unit tests, integration tests, &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; end-to-end tests. Must have &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-title&quot;&gt;five&lt;/span&gt; (&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-params&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-number&quot;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;) years of experience &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;with&lt;/span&gt; writing maintainable code &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;with&lt;/span&gt; Python &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;or&lt;/span&gt; Go&lt;/span&gt;; mentoring junior engineers; leading product engineering initiatives; writing technical specifications &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; distributed systems; proficiency &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; designing &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; implementing high performance APIs &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;using&lt;/span&gt; gRPC &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; Protocol Buffers; &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; extensive experience &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; developing, deploying, &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; managing applications &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;on&lt;/span&gt; a Kubernetes platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary: $&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-number&quot;&gt;243&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-number&quot;&gt;800&lt;/span&gt;-$&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-number&quot;&gt;303&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span class=&quot;hljs-number&quot;&gt;000&lt;/span&gt;/year&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Qualified Applicants: Click &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-string&quot;&gt;&quot;Apply&quot;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-keyword&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; follow directions to submit application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The range we’ve posted represents the typical compensation range for this role. To determine actual compensation, we review the market rate for each candidate which can include a variety of factors. These include qualifications, experience, interview performance, and location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, we offer a variety of benefits to support your needs. The benefits below reflect our US-based offerings for full-time employees; for roles in other locations, benefits vary and are shared during the hiring process. These include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, dental, and vision insurance - 100% paid for by CoreWeave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid Life Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Voluntary supplemental life insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short and long-term disability insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Spending Account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Savings Account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to Participate in Employee Stock Purchase Program (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Wellness Benefits through Spring Health&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-Forming support provided by Carrot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Parental Leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, full-service childcare support with Kinside&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with a generous employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Catered lunch each day in our office and data center locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A casual work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work culture focused on innovative disruption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;California Applicants&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gPBRBhUNAMBmj7Yn4_M-hCugm7ZJD4hr/view?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;California Consumer Privacy Act&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity &amp;amp; Accommodations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CoreWeave is an equal opportunity employer, committed to fostering an inclusive and supportive workplace. All qualified applicants and candidates will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, disability, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran status, or genetic information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of this commitment and consistent with the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/laws/guidance/fact-sheet-disability-discrimination&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;, CoreWeave will ensure that qualified applicants and candidates with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations for the hiring process, unless such accommodation would cause an undue hardship. If reasonable accommodation is needed, please contact: &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:careers@coreweave.com&quot;&gt;careers@coreweave.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Export Control Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires access to export controlled information. To conform to U.S. Government export regulations applicable to that information, applicant must either be (A) a U.S. person, defined as a (i) U.S. citizen or national, (ii) U.S. lawful permanent resident (green card holder), (iii) refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, or (iv) asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, (B) eligible to access the export controlled information without a required export authorization, or (C) eligible and reasonably likely to obtain the required export authorization from the applicable U.S. government agency. &amp;nbsp;CoreWeave may, for legitimate business reasons, decline to pursue any export licensing process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_quote&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_1770241969069985273m_-2746164444908759431gmail-docs-internal-guid-131e4fb0-7fff-b4e9-ff50-e8cf32449b1b&quot;&gt;CoreWeave is The Essential Cloud for AI™. Built for pioneers by pioneers, CoreWeave delivers a platform of technology, tools, and teams that enables innovators to build and scale AI with confidence. Trusted by leading AI labs, startups, and global enterprises, CoreWeave combines superior infrastructure performance with deep technical expertise to accelerate breakthroughs and turn compute into capability. Founded in 2017, CoreWeave became a publicly traded company (Nasdaq: CRWV) in March 2025. Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.coreweave.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://www.coreweave.com&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1762613132717000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3D-UOhNaqEvF5BEWxjYyAU&quot;&gt;www.coreweave.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;CoreWeave is looking for a Senior Talent Sourcer (Contract) to help drive high-impact hiring across several of the company’s most important and fast-moving organizations. This person will support executive and senior-level talent work across Operations and IT, Revenue and GTM, and select G&amp;amp;A and Marketing functions. The role is especially aligned to complex, business-critical hiring tied to infrastructure, operations, and commercial scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This is not a narrow top-of-funnel sourcer role. We are looking for someone who operates as a hybrid of sourcer, researcher, and talent partner — someone who can build and maintain executive-level pipelines, generate market intelligence, create real momentum on hard searches, and step in wherever needed to help move a search forward.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The ideal person is highly organized, deeply research-oriented, strong with executive-level candidate messaging, fluent in modern AI sourcing and outreach tools, and comfortable engaging directly with senior stakeholders. This person should bring sharp market instincts, excellent follow-through, and the ability to combine automation with the highly personalized approach needed for executive talent. This role is designed around the kind of sourcing motion described in our internal sourcing and sourcer/recruiter operating models: talent mapping, calibration, outreach strategy, executive-grade research, and proactive pipeline building with clear ownership and measurable outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scope and responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This role will primarily support executive and senior-level searches across several of CoreWeave’s most important functions and should be capable of shifting focus quickly based on business need.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;COO / Operations and IT organizations, including Operations, IT, Supply Chain, Data Center, infrastructure-adjacent hiring, and select international roles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;CIO-aligned IT functions, including networking, infrastructure, systems administration, and related technical operational hiring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;CRO / Revenue and GTM organizations, including sales, revenue, business development, solutions, post-sales, and other commercial functions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Select engineering-adjacent roles tied to field engineering, solutions engineering, and occasional light software engineering support where needed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Other significant areas of support include Marketing and G&amp;amp;A (Legal, People Ops, Finance, Procurement, Executive Support)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This person will operate as a hybrid of sourcer, researcher, and talent partner. They will be expected to build and maintain strong, always-on executive pipelines; conduct deep market research and talent mapping; identify target companies and adjacent talent pools; and create executive-grade candidate lists, market briefs, and search insights that help shape strategy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;They should be excellent at highly personalized outreach and candidate messaging, with the ability to attract hard-to-reach executive talent using a mix of automation, research, creativity, and strong follow-up. This person should be comfortable using modern AI sourcing and outreach tools, tracking outreach analytics and funnel health, and adjusting strategy based on real-time conversion data and market signal.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The role also requires strong partnership with recruiters and hiring leaders. This includes attending intake, calibration, and stakeholder meetings; contributing informed market perspective; conducting initial candidate conversations as needed; helping qualify early interest; and moving candidates forward by coordinating hiring manager and panel interviews before handing off to the recruiter at the appropriate stage. This person should be ready to clear roadblocks, keep multiple high-priority searches moving, and act as a strong market-facing representative of the talent function.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Significant experience in talent sourcing, executive sourcing, recruiting research, talent intelligence, executive search, or a closely related recruiting function&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong track record supporting executive or senior-level hiring across multiple major functional areas, ideally spanning some combination of Operations, IT, Supply Chain, Data Center, Revenue, GTM, G&amp;amp;A, or Marketing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Deep research capability — someone who is not just generating names, but producing usable insight, market perspective, and search direction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent executive-level messaging instincts and the ability to engage difficult-to-reach talent with credibility and personalization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong sourcing judgment across multiple channels, including LinkedIn, referrals, CRM/ATS rediscovery, adjacent market mapping, and non-obvious talent paths&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;High comfort level with modern AI sourcing, research, and outreach tools, and the judgment to use them well&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong data and analytics orientation, including comfort using outreach metrics, funnel insights, and search diagnostics to adjust strategy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of leveling and talent calibration, especially in large-scale tech environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Executive presence and confidence in meetings with senior stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Very strong organization and follow-through, with the ability to juggle a high volume of requirements at once, stay on top of many moving pieces, and not drop the ball in a fast-paced environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A highly proactive operating style — someone who sees gaps, clears blockers, and pushes work forward without waiting to be told&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong market instincts, including knowing which companies tend to produce strong talent for specific functions, levels, and environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A strong existing network in relevant talent markets is highly desirable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience supporting executive or highly strategic searches in high-growth technology, infrastructure, cloud, hyperscaler, data center, or AI-related environments is strongly preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience supporting searches that combine operational scale with technical complexity is strongly preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Business, Operations, IT, and GTM talent markets at companies with strong leveling discipline and mature hiring systems is preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience operating in fast-moving environments where priorities can shift quickly and searches require both rigor and creativity is preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience supporting international hiring, global market mapping, or contractor/FTE blended talent strategies is a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How this role should operate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The right person for this role will behave like a high-leverage talent partner, not just a requisition helper. They should be capable of building a search strategy, pressure-testing assumptions, producing meaningful research, creating a strong candidate narrative, and driving sustained top-of-funnel momentum at all times. Internally, this should look much closer to a strategic sourcer/researcher model than a traditional transactional sourcing motion — the kind of work where market intelligence, tooling fluency, search discipline, and executive communication all matter together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Preferred: Livingston, NJ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Open to other CoreWeave hub locations or remote, depending on fit and business need&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why CoreWeave?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At CoreWeave, we work hard, have fun, and move fast!&amp;nbsp; We’re in an exciting stage of hyper-growth that you will not want to miss out on. We’re not afraid of a little chaos, and we’re constantly learning. Our team cares deeply about how we build our product and how we work together, which is represented through our core values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Be Curious at Your Core&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Act Like an Owner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Empower Employees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Deliver Best-in-Class Client Experiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Achieve More Together&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We support and encourage an entrepreneurial outlook and independent thinking. We foster an environment that encourages collaboration and provides the opportunity to develop innovative solutions to complex problems. As we get set for take off, the growth opportunities within the organization are constantly expanding. You will be surrounded by some of the best talent in the industry, who will want to learn from you, too. Come join us!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a contract position. The hourly rate will be determined based on experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
