&lt;li&gt;Experience in AI, cloud, enterprise technology, or another fast-moving, highly technical industry is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting communications for infrastructure-intensive businesses such as data centers, energy, manufacturing, industrial technology, logistics, telecommunications, or similar is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
