&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operations is one of CoreWeave&#39;s largest and most operationally complex functions, and it requires a People Business Partner who can match its pace and scale. We&#39;re looking for a Senior Manager, People Business Partner to own the strategic partnership with Operations senior leadership while also working closely with a team of PBPs to ensure consistent, high-quality people support across the Ops organization. The right person builds credibility fast with operational leaders, thrives in high-volume and ambiguous environments, and knows how to maintain a high bar of accountability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact Will Be Felt Across Various Dimensions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;: Serve as the senior HR partner to Operations leadership, embedded in strategic planning, workforce decisions, and org design as we scale globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expansion&lt;/strong&gt;: Lead the PBP workstream on expansion in partnership with internal People teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workforce Planning&lt;/strong&gt;: Translate growth into headcount planning in close partnership with Talent Acquisition and other internal People teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Leadership Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Partner with Operations leaders on executive development, coaching, and succession planning for the senior leadership population.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Calibration&lt;/strong&gt;: Drive talent mapping and calibration for Ops leadership, holding the bar on job architecture and leveling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Org Design&lt;/strong&gt;: Advise Operations leaders on org structure, spans and layers, and headcount decisions as our team structures evolve across new geographies and facilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Risk &amp;amp; Workplace Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;: Consult on complex people matters, balancing risk, speed, and business practicality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wondering if you&#39;re a good fit?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in investing in our people and value candidates who can bring their own diverse experiences to our teams—even if you aren&#39;t a 100% skill or experience match. Here are a few qualities we&#39;ve found make people thrive here:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Be Curious at Your Core: You ask thoughtful questions, seek to understand root causes, and apply learnings to improve outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Act Like an Owner: You take responsibility for your cases and follow through with care and attention to detail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Empower Employees: You champion an equitable employee experience by coaching leaders and ensuring employees feel heard, supported, and treated fairly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Deliver Best-in-Class Client Experiences: You approach managers, employees, and cross-functional partners with professionalism, empathy, and consistency, ensuring they feel supported in even the most challenging moments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Achieve More Together: You collaborate seamlessly with People Business Partners, and other People teams, recognizing that the best solutions come from working as one team with shared goals.&lt;/p&gt;
