&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;1:1-1:20;0-19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;3:1-3:933;21-953&quot;&gt;As a Senior Product Marketing Manager for CoreWeave software products like W&amp;amp;B Models and W&amp;amp;B Weave, you will help define and scale the narratives, product launches, and go-to-market strategy for the platform that AI researchers and developers rely on to build, evaluate, and improve AI models and agents. You will sit at the intersection of AI research, model and agent development, and production AI operations, translating deeply technical capabilities into compelling stories that resonate with AI researchers, engineers, platform teams, and technical decision-makers. Working closely with Product, Engineering, Sales, Developer Relations, and Customer Marketing, you&#39;ll help shape how the market understands and adopts the next generation of AI development workflows. This is a highly cross-functional role that requires technical fluency, excellent communication skills, and a passion for helping developers build better AI products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;5:1-5:20;955-974&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;7:1-7:431;976-1406&quot;&gt;As Product Marketing Manager, you will be responsible for defining the value proposition, positioning, messaging, and GTM strategy for CoreWeave&#39;s AI researcher and developer tools. We offer a broad portfolio of products spanning experiment tracking, model evaluation, AI observability, agent development, and MLOps, helping the world&#39;s leading AI teams build, evaluate, and operate AI models and agents with confidence and speed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-9:637;1408-2044&quot;&gt;This role sits at the forefront of our purpose-built tools for accelerating the agent loop. You&#39;ll help shape the future of agent workflows, enabling agents to run, generate traces, be evaluated, incorporate feedback, and continuously improve through an iterative development cycle. You will work with key stakeholders in marketing, sales, product management and engineering to shape CoreWeave&#39;s software portfolio growth. You&#39;re eager to listen to customers, understand the mechanics of how we win in the market, and package key insights into scalable value propositions in close collaboration with other teams across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-11:339;2046-2384&quot;&gt;This is an opportunity to lead the industry with unmatched performance, breakthrough innovations, and differentiated value propositions. It is critical that you leverage data and analytics to demonstrate impact of your work through metrics from adoption to deal flow in a way that is intuitive for your stakeholders and senior executives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;13:1-13:26;2386-2411&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Positioning &amp;amp; Messaging&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;14:1-17:147;2412-3047&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;14:1-14:164;2412-2575&quot;&gt;Develop compelling positioning and messaging for products across experiment tracking, model evaluation, agent observability improvement and, and MLOps workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;15:1-15:193;2576-2768&quot;&gt;Create narratives, demos, and product storytelling that clearly communicate CoreWeave&#39;s differentiation and value to AI researchers, engineers, platform teams, and technical decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;16:1-16:132;2769-2900&quot;&gt;Support product launches with persona-driven messaging grounded in customer insights, market research, and product adoption data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;17:1-17:147;2901-3047&quot;&gt;Partner with Demand Generation and Content Marketing to develop campaign briefs and messaging frameworks that scale across the customer journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;19:1-19:38;3049-3086&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Customer Advocacy &amp;amp; Market Insights&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;20:1-24:112;3087-3760&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;20:1-20:113;3087-3199&quot;&gt;Partner with Customer Success and Sales teams to uncover customer stories, use cases, and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;21:1-21:139;3200-3338&quot;&gt;Develop customer case studies, testimonials, and reference materials that demonstrate the business and technical impact of our products.&lt;/li&gt;
