&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;14,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Stack Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven expertise in modern backend (e.g., &lt;strong&gt;FastAPI, gRPC&lt;/strong&gt;) and frontend technologies (e.g., &lt;strong&gt;React, Next&lt;/strong&gt;), including the development of scalable backend services in Node.js and Go.&lt;/li&gt;
