&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;14,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid experience designing and implementing &lt;strong&gt;RESTful APIs, microservices&lt;/strong&gt;, and event-driven integration architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
