&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-11:238;1175-1412&quot;&gt;You bring 7+ years of hands-on experience in Platform Engineering, Infrastructure Engineering, or building highly scalable distributed systems — with a strong foundation in software design, development, and algorithmic problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;12:1-12:197;1413-1609&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Platform Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity operating data platforms or data-intensive workloads, including distributed processing and streaming frameworks such as Spark, Airflow, Kafka, or Flink.&lt;/li&gt;
