&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure audit-grade lineage so every billed dollar traces back to verified usage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
