&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Drive technical initiatives and mentor engineers as the team grows its Go and production skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
