&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ve shipped and scaled business critical, financially compliant services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You have drafted and owned SLAs/SLOs, observability tooling, and sustainable on-call&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You have a sharp sense for correctness and prioritize accuracy, completeness, and penny-precision.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
