&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1f7k7t5&quot; data-start=&quot;1811&quot; data-end=&quot;1894&quot;&gt;Experience operating Kubernetes clusters at scale, especially for AI workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bp1s9c&quot; data-start=&quot;1895&quot; data-end=&quot;2048&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience with logging, tracing, and metrics platforms in production, with deep knowledge of cardinality, indexing, and query optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wxkhxd&quot; data-start=&quot;2049&quot; data-end=&quot;2183&quot;&gt;Experienced in running distributed systems or API services at cloud scale, including event streaming and data pipeline management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1tn5pkx&quot; data-start=&quot;2184&quot; data-end=&quot;2275&quot;&gt;Familiarity with LLM frameworks, MCP, and agentic tooling (e.g., Langchain, AgentCore).&lt;/li&gt;
