&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;3:1-3:450;21-470&quot;&gt;CoreWeave is seeking a highly skilled and motivated Senior Systems Engineer, Legal Systems to build and scale our contract lifecycle management (CLM) and legal technology ecosystem, with a primary focus on Ironclad. In this role, you will partner closely with Legal, Legal Operations, Finance, Sales, GTM, Procurement, Security, and IT to design, implement, and optimize legal systems and workflows that support a fast-growing, complex organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;5:1-5:20;472-491&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;7:1-7:182;493-674&quot;&gt;You will play a critical role in streamlining contract processes, improving data visibility, and ensuring integrations across enterprise systems are secure, scalable, and compliant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-19:98;676-1938&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-9:135;676-810&quot;&gt;Own the administration, configuration, and optimization of Ironclad CLM, including workflows, templates, approvals, and permissions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;10:1-10:137;811-947&quot;&gt;Partner with Legal and Legal Operations stakeholders to translate contract and compliance requirements into scalable system solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-11:137;948-1084&quot;&gt;Design and maintain contract workflows across the full lifecycle, from intake and negotiation through execution, storage, and renewal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;12:1-12:134;1085-1218&quot;&gt;Build and support integrations between Ironclad and enterprise systems (e.g., CRM, ERP, procurement, billing, identity management).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;13:1-13:137;1219-1355&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain reports, dashboards, and analytics to support contract visibility, compliance tracking, and operational insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;14:1-14:116;1356-1471&quot;&gt;Manage system security, access controls, and data governance to ensure confidentiality and regulatory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
