&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;1:1-1:20;0-19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;3:1-3:640;21-660&quot;&gt;The Cloud Platform API team builds the platform and infrastructure that front CoreWeave&#39;s control plane. This role sits with the group that owns the API Gateway (the single secure front door for control-plane traffic) and the Kubernetes Gateway, one secure endpoint into every CoreWeave Kubernetes Service (CKS) cluster control plane, public or private. The team runs the Envoy and Kubernetes Gateway API stack that carries every customer, CLI, console, and Terraform request. This is high-leverage infrastructure at CoreWeave: the gateway is the choke point, and its latency and availability are what customers perceive as the platform&#39;s.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;5:1-5:20;662-681&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;7:1-7:821;683-1503&quot;&gt;As a Senior Engineer on the Cloud Platform API team, you&#39;ll design and operate the gateways that front the entire control plane. You&#39;ll drive large-scale networking migrations, such as moving from NGINX/HAProxy to Envoy across every zone with no customer-visible regression, and own routing, TLS/mTLS, rate limiting, and observability across the stack. You&#39;ll set technical direction for how the team runs its infrastructure, anticipate problems before they turn into incidents, and help stand up new customer-facing features for this infra. You&#39;ll also mentor other engineers, lead post-mortems, and act as a trusted advisor across teams like CKS, VPC, IAM, Cloud Console, and more. This role sits on a technical-leadership track, and we especially welcome engineers interested in eventually leading or managing a team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-9:24;1505-1528&quot;&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-15:112;1530-2191&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-11:118;1530-1647&quot;&gt;Own the API and Kubernetes Gateways API stacks and their CRDs: routing, TLS/mTLS, rate limiting, and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;12:1-12:156;1648-1803&quot;&gt;Drive large-scale infrastructure migrations (for example, HAProxy → Envoy) across every zone with one audit-log shape and no customer-visible regression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;13:1-13:170;1804-1973&quot;&gt;Manage networking and traffic at scale: L4/L7 proxying, load balancing, global routing, live failover to healthy backends, encrypted transport, and performance tuning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;14:1-14:106;1974-2079&quot;&gt;Set technical direction across the gateway stack and define the engineering standards the team follows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;15:1-15:112;2080-2191&quot;&gt;Mentor senior and mid-level engineers, lead post-mortems, and act as a bridge across teams and to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;17:1-17:17;2193-2209&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;19:1-24:87;2211-2858&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;19:1-19:36;2211-2246&quot;&gt;Production experience writing Go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;20:1-20:145;2247-2391&quot;&gt;Deep experience with networking and traffic infrastructure: L4/L7 load balancing, reverse proxies (Envoy, HAProxy, or NGINX), or API gateways.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;21:1-21:171;2392-2562&quot;&gt;Deep Kubernetes experience, ideally with the Gateway API or Ingress, operators and controllers, and running multiple clusters and the applications deployed across them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;22:1-22:123;2563-2685&quot;&gt;A strong grounding in TLS/mTLS and edge and authentication concerns, plus performance tuning of network-facing services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;23:1-23:86;2686-2771&quot;&gt;A track record of setting technical direction and leading initiatives across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;24:1-24:87;2772-2858&quot;&gt;Clear communication about your technical contributions and cross-team collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
