&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;28:1-31:69;2876-3270&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;28:1-28:72;2876-2947&quot;&gt;Experience leading a large-scale infrastructure migration end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;29:1-29:128;2948-3075&quot;&gt;Experience operating a high-traffic edge or gateway as a production choke point: monitoring, runbooks, and incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;30:1-30:126;3076-3201&quot;&gt;Experience with certificate issuance and rotation (for example, via Vault) and with multi-zone or federated control planes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;31:1-31:69;3202-3270&quot;&gt;Interest in a technical-leadership or engineering-management path.&lt;/li&gt;
