&lt;li&gt;Follow on-call runbooks and learn incident response in a guided rotation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to performance experiments (e.g., request batching, concurrency, caching) with guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
