&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of cloud infrastructure for AI workloads, including GPU compute, high-performance networking, and storage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience using Slurm or Kubernetes for ML job orchestration, especially in air-gapped or classified environments&lt;/li&gt;
