&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;You&#39;re mission-driven — you want your technical work to translate into outcomes that matter for national security, public services, and the country, not just enterprise software adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;You see compliance and security constraints as design problems, not blockers — you find satisfaction in making frontier AI actually work inside FedRAMP, classified networks, and air-gapped clusters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;You see the problem through your customer&#39;s eyes — their mission constraints, their compliance requirements, their internal politics — before you reach for a solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why CoreWeave?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;At CoreWeave, we work hard, have fun, and move fast! We&#39;re in an exciting stage of hyper-growth that you will not want to miss out on. We&#39;re not afraid of a little chaos, and we&#39;re constantly learning. Our team cares deeply about how we build our product and how we work together, which is represented through our core values:&lt;/p&gt;
