&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CoreWeave is looking for a Sr. Engineering Manager to lead the core team for our next-generation Inference Platform.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
