&lt;p&gt;As a Sr. Technical Program Manager on the Capacity Delivery team, you will own the end-to-end delivery of our most critical data center infrastructure. You will be the single-threaded leader responsible for translating long-range capacity forecasts and complex customer requirements into fully commissioned infrastructure. This highly visible role requires deep cross-functional leadership across Engineering, Supply Chain, and Data Center Operations to solve technical challenges at hyperscale. Beyond delivering individual programs, you will be instrumental in designing the scalable, repeatable processes that define how we build our global fleet for the future&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
