&lt;p data-start=&quot;5109&quot; data-end=&quot;5241&quot;&gt;Be Curious at Your Core&lt;br data-start=&quot;5132&quot; data-end=&quot;5135&quot;&gt;Act Like an Owner&lt;br data-start=&quot;5152&quot; data-end=&quot;5155&quot;&gt;Empower Employees&lt;br data-start=&quot;5172&quot; data-end=&quot;5175&quot;&gt;Deliver Best-in-Class Client Experiences&lt;br data-start=&quot;5215&quot; data-end=&quot;5218&quot;&gt;Achieve More Together&lt;/p&gt;
