&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Information Systems, Computer Science, Finance, Accounting, Business Administration, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of experience implementing and supporting enterprise tax technology solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of hands-on experience with multiple tax platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of indirect tax processes including:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales &amp;amp; Use Tax&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VAT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GST&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global indirect tax compliance&lt;/li&gt;
