&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NetSuite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SAP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oracle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating tax systems with procurement, billing, e-commerce, and financial applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of enterprise integration technologies including APIs, middleware, and iPaaS platforms (Workato, Boomi, MuleSoft, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with REST/SOAP APIs, web services, and enterprise integration patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of tax content updates, jurisdiction management, tax rules, and exemption certificate management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting tax audits, SOX controls, and regulatory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and troubleshooting skills with the ability to resolve complex tax system issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead large-scale enterprise initiatives and collaborate across cross-functional global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
