&lt;li class=&quot;li3&quot;&gt;Advanced degree or specialized coursework in networking or distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wondering if you’re a good fit?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
