&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; on the Identity &amp;amp; Access Management (IAM) team, you will be a primary architect of CoreWeave’s IAM strategy as we rapidly expand the platform. You will leverage your deep expertise in identity systems to design, extend, and harden a platform that secures our high-performance cloud infrastructure. This is a high-impact leadership role where you will balance rapid execution with the long-term technical vision necessary to meet the demands of our global enterprise customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Strategy &amp;amp; Vision:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Product and Engineering Leadership to translate complex requirements into a multi-year technical roadmap that balances immediate business needs with long-term architectural integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the design and implementation of high-throughput, low-latency distributed systems for authentication and authorization across all CoreWeave services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Evolution:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect customer-facing experiences for identity lifecycle management, IdP integration (SAML/OIDC), and granular permissioning models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion a security-first mindset across the organization, establishing rigorous standards for code quality, design reviews, and threat modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Elevate the team’s operational maturity by defining SLOs, enhancing deep-stack observability, and driving automation to eliminate systemic toil&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a force multiplier by mentoring Senior engineers and fostering a culture of continuous learning and high-performance engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive alignment on critical security initiatives across the broader engineering organization, articulating complex technical trade-offs to stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8+ Years of Experience&lt;/strong&gt; building and operating large-scale distributed systems in a production environment using one or more of Go, TypeScript, or React&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ Years of IAM Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of developing identity products and a deep mastery of standards including &lt;strong&gt;OIDC, OAuth2.0, SAML, and JWT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience leading large, cross-functional projects from inception to planet-scale deployment with measurable business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud-Native Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of Kubernetes, microservices architecture at scale, and advanced CI/CD patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Security Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid knowledge of the security, compliance (SOC2, HIPAA, etc.), and governance needs of sophisticated enterprise customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Superb ability to synthesize ambiguous requirements into clear technical designs and communicate trade-offs to both executive and technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert-level ability to debug complex, intermittent issues within distributed environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architectural Transformation:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience leading the decomposition of monolithic architectures into high-performance microservices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Augmented Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with leveraging AI agents (e.g., Claude, Cursor) to accelerate the software development lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Emerging Tech Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with AI/ML workloads, GPU-based infrastructure, and the unique security challenges of MLOps at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Policy-as-Code:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with modern authorization frameworks such as Open Policy Agent (OPA) or Cedar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wondering if you’re a good fit? We believe in investing in our people, and value candidates who can bring their own diversified experiences to our teams – even if you aren&#39;t a 100% skill or experience match. Here are a few qualities we’ve found compatible with our team. If some of this describes you, we’d love to talk.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
