&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2674&quot; data-end=&quot;3106&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vevsvr&quot; data-start=&quot;2674&quot; data-end=&quot;2792&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Recruiters across multiple business functions to support hiring initiatives and talent programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;onadmd&quot; data-start=&quot;2793&quot; data-end=&quot;2895&quot;&gt;Maintain accurate recruiting data and reporting across Greenhouse, Gem, and project management tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;139xa61&quot; data-start=&quot;2896&quot; data-end=&quot;3002&quot;&gt;Help improve recruiting processes, talent programs, and operational workflows as the organization scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rnt5dl&quot; data-start=&quot;3003&quot; data-end=&quot;3106&quot;&gt;Support cross-functional Talent Acquisition initiatives and special projects as business needs evolve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
