&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience sourcing for &lt;strong&gt;technical roles&lt;/strong&gt; (engineering, infrastructure, or cloud-related roles)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong&gt;early careers programs, internships, or university partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
