&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love making complicated technical topics clear to the people who need them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re curious about how engineers actually learn, and you pay attention to what does and does not land.&lt;/li&gt;
