&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead and drive execution for end-to-end technical program management for critical cloud infrastructure initiatives, including planning, execution, delivery, and retrospectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Define program scope, milestones, and success metrics while managing risks and dependencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Partner closely with engineering, product management, operations, and security teams to ensure alignment on priorities and deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
