&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead cross-functional programs for customer onboarding across dedicated and serverless inference offerings, ensuring clear ownership, launch criteria, and readiness for strategic customer use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Drive launch readiness for new inference capabilities by aligning teams around real customer outcomes, supportability, and end-to-end validation&lt;/li&gt;
