&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;You’re curious about&lt;/span&gt; emerging networking technologies, market dynamics, and how supplier roadmaps can shape long-term infrastructure strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
