&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;3:1-3:282;21-302&quot;&gt;Join our dynamic Global Supplier Management and Technical Sourcing team, where you&#39;ll be a key driver in forging strategic partnerships that fuel technical innovation, uphold rigorous quality standards, and deliver significant cost savings through optimized supply chain solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;5:1-5:20;304-323&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;7:1-7:541;325-865&quot;&gt;As a Technical Sourcing Manager, Storage and Components, you&#39;ll be the commercial lead for critical components for AI hardware systems and products powering our cutting-edge data center deployments. You&#39;ll spearhead strategic sourcing initiatives, build robust supplier relationships, and ensure supply chain resilience by developing diverse sourcing options. Your expertise will be vital in navigating the hardware landscape, leading complex negotiations, and collaborating with engineering teams to shape business and technology roadmaps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-9:409;867-1275&quot;&gt;Leveraging your deep industry knowledge and strategic supplier connections, you&#39;ll optimize the total cost of ownership for our rapidly expanding global infrastructure. You&#39;ll lead cross-functional teams through the supplier selection process for new platforms and components, secure favorable agreements, and continuously assess supplier performance across cost, quality, delivery, and technology alignment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-17:130;1277-2384&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-11:190;1277-1466&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Sourcing Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop, implement, and refine comprehensive sourcing strategies and roadmaps to drive continuous improvement across components and third party storage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;12:1-12:156;1467-1622&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Intelligence &amp;amp; Competitive Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a pulse on emerging technologies and industry trends to conduct insightful competitive analyses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;13:1-13:177;1623-1799&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplier Relationship Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate and nurture strong relationships with leadership at core suppliers, influencing their business models and technology roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;14:1-14:125;1800-1924&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Negotiation &amp;amp; Contract Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead complex supplier negotiations, manage RFQs/RFPs, and finalize business awards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;15:1-15:111;1925-2035&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract Lifecycle Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and implement Master Supply Agreements and statements of work (SOWs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;16:1-16:219;2036-2254&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Product Introduction (NPI) &amp;amp; Production Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive commercial engagements for prototype sourcing and development, supporting seamless transitions from NPI to mass production ensuring continuity of supply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;17:1-17:130;2255-2384&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supply Chain Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Propose and implement innovative supply chain enhancements to drive efficiency and cost savings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;19:1-19:17;2386-2402&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;21:1-27:86;2404-3160&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;21:1-21:144;2404-2547&quot;&gt;5+ years of proven experience in data center, hyperscaler, cloud service provider, or AI system hardware supply chain and related industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;22:1-22:178;2548-2725&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Electrical Engineering, a related technical field, or Business Administration. Equivalent experience in high-tech commodity management will be considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;23:1-23:88;2726-2813&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to translate strategy into tangible results and drive execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;24:1-24:71;2814-2884&quot;&gt;Exceptional negotiation, influencing, and consensus-building skills.&lt;/li&gt;
