&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;27:1-27:86;3075-3160&quot;&gt;Proven experience partnering with C-suite executives and key supplier stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
