&lt;p&gt;Your main goal will be to quickly get answers to all user messages. Customers write in with highly technical questions, suggestions, or bug reports, and we need to give them timely responses to fulfill SLAs. Ideally, we&#39;re looking for someone with technical skills who would like to support our customer base. If you&#39;ve found yourself wanting to be more external but still build programming/machine learning skills, this is the role for you.&lt;/p&gt;
